.Dd June 26, 2026
.Dt LIBPHDI 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm libphdi.h
.Nd Library to access the Parallels Hard Disk image (PHDI) format
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In libphdi.h
.Pp
